# ── the local AI harness — NEVER public ─────────────────────────────────────
# .claude/ holds the session's local state. settings.local.json in particular
# records every folder a session was granted, which on this machine means the
# private toolkit and the war room. The guard hook and settings.json are generic,
# but nothing under this directory is worth the risk of one local write leaking.
.claude/
.cursor/
.aider*
.copilot*
.continue/
*.local.json
*.local.md
*.local.*

# ── secrets — no exceptions, no "temporarily" ───────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
keystore/
keystores/
*.keystore
*.wallet
wallet*.json
*.seed
seed*.txt
mnemonic*
secrets/
.secrets/
secrets.*
*.secret
*.token
*.credentials

# ── planning material — lives in a private runtime, never in this tree ──────
# The event's planning corpus is disclosed by name in specs/ and cited in prose.
# The rest of it — schedules, rulings, slot decisions, prize arithmetic — is not
# part of the contribution and does not belong in a public history. These names
# are a tripwire: if one of them appears here, it arrived by accident.
STATE.md
MVP-PATH.md
SLOT-DECISION.md
BATTLE-PLAN.md
PLAYBOOK.md
PREBUILD.md
BOOTSTRAP.md
WINNERS-EVIDENCE.md
UNISWAP-NEEDS.md
